<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Causality ≠ Invariance:Function and Concept Vectors in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Significance Test for RSA–AIE Head Overlap</span></a></li>
